flowchart TB
    R[Researcher] --> C[Research Contract]
    C --> E[Cusimanse Experiment Configuration]
    E --> GR[Goose Recipe: title + description + instructions/prompt]
    E --> P[Prompt Reference: cross-agent handoff]
    GR --> A{Selected Primary Agent}
    P --> A
    A -->|Goose native| G[Goose Reference Operator]
    A -->|Validated adapter| O[OpenCode / Hermes / Antigravity / Pi]
    G --> N[Native planning + semantic role delegation]
    O --> N2[Native tools / plugins / skills / MCP]
    N --> X[Lima/QEMU disposable VM]
    N2 --> X
    X --> I[Guest instrumentation profile]
    I --> W[Recipe-defined workload]
    W --> EV[Evidence + session.yaml]
    EV --> S1[Specialist analysis / forensics / detection]
    S1 --> V[Independent verifier]
    V --> RP[Research report]
    RP --> PR[Preserve provenance + hashes]
    PR --> D[Destroy VM]
    RP --> L{learning.enabled = true?}
    L -->|No| END[Complete]
    L -->|Yes| LR[Retrieve prior skills/evidence]
    LR --> LP[Propose → execute → evaluate → refine → replay]
    LP --> LI[Independent verification]
    LI --> HA[Human approval]
    HA --> SK[Promote candidate → skills/validated]
    SK --> END
    H[Mandatory host capabilities] --> A
    M[Mandatory gateways: OmniRoute → LiteLLM] --> A
    T[Mandatory observability: Numbat + Aegis + Phoenix/OTel + ClawMetry] --> EV
    CU[Optional Container Use] -. additional environment .-> X
